摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness community plugin: longgraph / loop-graph / loop-converge authoring skills on ctx.skills","id":"gh:1333715148","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-plugin-longgraph","slug":"levi-qiao/dsh-plugin-longgraph","topics":["cordis","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness community plugin: longgraph / loop-graph / loop-converge authoring skills on ctx.sk"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"Seek Harness community plugin: longgraph / loop-graph / loop-converge authoring skills on ctx.skills"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-plugin-longgraph"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Community **DeepSeek Harness** plugin that registers the longgraph authoring\nskills on `ctx.skills`."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> Community plugin. Not affiliated with or maintained by DeepSeek AI."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"This package is **DeepSeek Harness only**. It does not install or launch\nnodes on any other product."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"longgraph is a prompt\nlibrary for long-horizon agent work: an executor node, a ledger, and a\nclean-c"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ontext supervisor connected by a one-way directives edge. Each\nnode owns one timer. There is no wake"},{"id":"p7s3","text":" edge between them. This plugin\ndoes not add an agent runtime — it exposes that library through the\n"},{"id":"p7s4","text":" This plugin\ndoes not add an agent runtime — it exposes that library through the\nHarness skill seam."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Skills"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"After the plugin loads, `ctx.skills.list()` / `snapshot()` advertise:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Name | Role |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| `longgraph` | Fit check, then hand off to `loop-graph` |\n| `loop-graph` | Interview → compile `.lo"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"nggraph/<date-slug>/` → launch or print DSH prompts |\n| `loop-converge` | Code-convergence preset, t"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"hen the same compile |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"`get` / the model-facing `skill({ name })` path returns the full instruction\nbody. `resourceBase` po"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ints at the packaged skill directory so templates\nand `references/deepseek-harness.md`\nresolve."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness is in developer preview. This plugin pins\n`@deepseek-ai/dsh-skill` `>=0.1.0-rc.5 <0"},{"id":"p14s2","text":".2.0` and is tested against\nthe public `0.1.0-rc.6` line."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### Profile bundle (recommended)"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Then invoke `skill({ name: \"longgraph\" })` (or `loop-graph` /\n`loop-converge`)."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"`package.json` declares `dsh.bundle.patch`. The shipped\n`cordis.patch.yml` inserts one row named `ds"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"h-plugin-longgraph`. Profile\ncomposition applies that layer before the profile's own patch."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Pin a git commit when you want a frozen install:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Git installs fetch source, so `prepare` runs `tsdown`. With pnpm 10+, add\nthe package to the profile"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" `pnpm-workspace.yaml` build allowlist if pnpm\nblocks `prepare`, then retry."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Direct Cordis row"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The plugin `inject`s `skills` and calls `ctx.skills.registerProvider`.\nIt has no runtime config."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Timers on DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Two independent **root sessions**, two `schedule_create` clocks:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- `every_seconds` floor is 300 (five minutes).\n- Schedule is session-local — both sessions must stay"},{"id":"p27s2","text":" live.\n- A busy session waits until idle, then `followup()`. The timer does not\ninterrupt a fire.\n- "},{"id":"p27s3","text":"Never `followup()` / `inject()` the other session. The executor reads\nnew directives on its next fir"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"ver `followup()` / `inject()` the other session. The executor reads\nnew directives on its next fire."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"See the host reference."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| Peer | Range |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| `@deepseek-ai/cordis` | `>=4.0.1 <5` |\n| `@deepseek-ai/dsh-skill` | `>=0.1.0-rc.5 <0.2.0` |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Harness remains a developer preview. Compatibility-breaking changes will\nrequire a new plugin versio"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"rness remains a developer preview. Compatibility-breaking changes will\nrequire a new plugin version."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"`pnpm test` loads the shipped `apply` against a real `@deepseek-ai/dsh-skill`\n`SkillRegistry` and re"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"ads the packaged `SKILL.md` files. `pnpm integration`\nboots the same plugin through the public Cordi"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"ackaged `SKILL.md` files. `pnpm integration`\nboots the same plugin through the public Cordis Loader."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## What this is not"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"- Not a DeepSeek AI product and not an official Harness bundle.\n- Not a replacement for `dsh-agent-l"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"oop`, Schedule, Jobs, or the Web UI.\n- Not a multi-host skill pack. The sibling\nlonggraph-skill repo"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"\nremains the multi-host prompt library."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"MIT © 2026 levi-qiao"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
